{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1735","id":4145364308,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p873FT1U","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1735","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1735.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1735.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1735","number":1735,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Produce P3 Differentiation cumulative semantics","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #1725\n\nParent: #1721  \nPredecessor: #1724\n\n## What changed\n\nThis PR produces the complete discoverable Paper 3 Differentiation semantic shard and adds it to the cumulative `9709:paper:p3` authority.\n\n- Normalizes the established `qrow_WM_` source-key dialect to canonical structural Question IDs, admitting all 79 discoverable rows.\n- Terminally reviews all 127 score-owning QuestionParts with exact QP/MS evidence, including the ten parts recovered across seven resolver-verified watermark-key questions.\n- Adds six evidence-supported Differentiation QuestionTypes and shared ProcedureModels for explicit, implicit, and parametric differentiation; stationary-point solving; tangent/normal geometry; and stationary-point classification.\n- Preserves QuestionPart-grain primary/secondary ownership and ordered core procedure composition without promoting routine simplification, chain arithmetic, or value substitution into standalone models.\n- Isolates five evidence-bound supporting candidates from Trigonometry and Integration, plus five unmodeled Numerical Solution candidates, without exposing any candidate as approved.\n- Rebuilds the cumulative registry, procedure library, procedure composition, KG nodes/edges, active manifest, and authenticated product readback while preserving all #1722/#1723/#1724 authority.\n- Threads a shared full-release cache through the real #1722→#1725 builder chain, preserving lineage and raw-byte authentication while building each issue at most once per validation walk.\n- Computes question-named procedure usage metrics from distinct question identities.\n- Pins the runtime repository to the exact #1725 manifest/nodes/edges bytes and extends exhaustive service, API, and real-gateway readback coverage.\n\n## Metrics and gates\n\n- 79/79 discoverable Differentiation questions reviewed; 0 excluded\n- 127/127 score-owning QuestionParts terminally reviewed\n- 121 approved primary classifications; 26 secondary classifications\n- 147 approved core ProcedureInstances\n- 5 candidate supporting ProcedureInstances\n- 5 unmodeled foreign-family candidate parts\n- 0 invented alternative branches\n- 504 cumulative P3 semantic records\n- 17 cumulative ProcedureModels\n- procedure reuse ratio: 28.764706 distinct questions per model\n- product readback pass rate: 100%\n- structural authority writes: 0\n- provider calls / remote data writes: 0\n- dangling edges / duplicate identities / candidate-as-approved / cross-family primary conflicts: 0\n\nAuthenticated release bytes:\n\n- active manifest: `0fce9ace7a1f2266432672520a2ee0bb3eb04a360a905fbd702e56d9555ee883`\n- KG nodes: `8b8d4e15b9f622be9f37274cafb84dd2ebc75b711648e194358d3e745f197cdb`\n- KG edges: `eab0254c611c0853ec80416914fa80e6e2aea45571e34639d53d101146d76d2f`\n\n## Verification\n\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1725_differentiation_semantic_kg.test.py -v` — 12/12 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1724_trigonometry_semantic_kg.test.py -v` — 11/11 passed, including live successor byte tamper rejection\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1723_differential_equations_semantic_kg.test.py -v` — 9/9 passed\n- `python3 scripts/vlm/__tests__/issue_1722_p3_semantic_composition.test.py -v` — 13/13 passed in 62.7 seconds, including real one-build-per-issue and missing/length/hash drift regressions\n- direct real nested-build probe — `{1722: 1, 1723: 1, 1724: 1, 1725: 1}` in 17.9 seconds\n- deterministic `--check` for #1722, #1723, #1724, and #1725 — PASS against active release\n- repository-root lockfile-pinned Jest readback service, API, and real gateway — 50/50 passed\n- targeted ESLint, Python byte compilation, and `git diff --check` — PASS\n","created_at":"2026-07-27T19:13:36Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T21:34:02Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T21:26:24Z","merged_at":"2026-07-27T21:26:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"3435a14e61f8da8640ee0388d457f712ad25d6a0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1735/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1735/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1735/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/c53c77667926fb94268eac6d6ae63da7c966f7